00_AfyMRaXCqH-WAT4dEXI1a1rXxc_fxwAGEf1exJX4_oa-zQ&oe=69B2A961"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-03.png", "id": "1013963573823261", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_1013963577156594_2061989920474998390_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zbi0D_8plMgQ7kNvwH3asn-&_nc_oc=AdmnkPOE6NmjGTsnrTz73S73sDqk3QUvpu7TeAOSmcVr_OhDxHDKMa19qU9w2eQQ-70&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz5lywIWI2e8pd7BO3dovNatZwnmY5x86woJONGX0pe1g&oe=69B2A316"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-05.png", "id": "2121495998306034", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982488_2121496001639367_6867377017957057624_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ObqNafFcHCYQ7kNvwG4j5zj&_nc_oc=AdkPp4-dJBw4YeocJYHiRaIW8S_Nr5WLqpq_i2w2kAXG8Duzv26UoSeFNWXIgSc8FnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzY-0RIrL4vQX9F2UKiSMKs3BORc2sBLxFfgxIS_4rbaQ&oe=69B2BD2A"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-01.png", "id": "1186035523063640", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974783_1186035526396973_4771898997726366931_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xlHnnCku1rAQ7kNvwF2pc3b&_nc_oc=Adlt4yCFJw2t1Sv6bDBmMCXRvOlHeX0xES3UJf-QTQ0zVN1ngu2Kgz3udg7FCYhOS-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyiqapuNbOKNYRTSkM7fhoxYCtAs2FG_LC7fEN4uP7rJw&oe=69B29B0F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "487841280996149", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031435_487841284329482_7014507726029390394_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Dg-JAEZl68Q7kNvwFJkGK4&_nc_oc=AdkWvHoB72uCwFjSHbP_lCrdg1iaI7OnuAcOoR_jIjjvdeDZXxZ13yiJx4a7D5bbVXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy86frtTT-AWP_eE2QaFKKRpGAzMI1gebip7RfOTD1q4Q&oe=69B29E71"}, "display_name": "Squingle", "keywords": ["puzzle", "mr", "puzzling", "squingle"], "long_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit.\n\n#  \u2728 100 LEVELS\nLaunching with 100 levels, with more added over time. Levels grow complex, featuring tighter spaces and new challenges.\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing sculpture, offering an unmatched visual experience in Mixed Reality or fully immersive modes.\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 EASY TO PICK, HARD TO MASTER\nDesigned to be accessible for both newcomers to VR and experts seeking a transcendent experience, with intuitive controls and hand tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c RELAX & UNWIND\nPlay on the sofa or in room-sized mazes. Squingle\u2019s calming gameplay will soothe your soul.\n\n# \ud83c\udfc5 AWARDS\n- Best VR Game ~ GDWC Finalist\n- Finalist ~ QLDXR Festival\n- \u201cBest of the Quest\u201d ~ Gibby\u2019s Guide\n\n# FEATURES\n- Challenge Mode: Time trials and global leaderboards.\n- Room/Mini scale: Play big or small!\n- Race your ghost: Beat your best times.\n\n\nGet ready to be Squingled!", "short_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit."}]}, "developer_name": "Dr.